# Functions are documented before their release. At release, remove these
# entries, restore the /feature-engineering/functions redirect to
# /management/function, publish the drafts marked "Draft for the Functions
# release", restore `availability` frontmatter (removed while gated, since
# the comparison table on index.mdx links every page that declares one,
# draft or not) to management/function.mdx and sql/ddl/function.mdx -- each
# currently carries a plain `<Badge color="red">Enterprise</Badge>` instead
